{"title":"Icethrower","slug":"Icethrower","hero":{"file":"Icethrower.webp","width":384,"height":309},"pageid":4873,"revid":21184,"timestamp":"2026-04-07T09:10:55Z","lastEditor":"Mister FARMILA","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Icethrower\">Icethrower</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The Icethrower is a reskin of the flame thrower, this is from the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Frozen_Flames/\">gift of frozen flames</a>. It can also make <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Frozen_Tree%3F%3F%3F/\">Frozen Trees</a>, which are limited. Tho you cant process trees that have been cut down.\n</p><p>Also it can break ice.\n</p>"}
